###### Menu Parameter Collection Filter Data ######

# Global values
# not quate strings
@org-user-id = admin
@org-user-pw = password
@base_org_url = http://platform-auth:{{org-mng-port}}
@organization_id = org1
@workspace_id = ws1


###
# パラメータ集の検索条件を全件取得する
GET {{base_org_url}}/api/{{organization_id}}/workspaces/{{workspace_id}}/ita/menu/parameter_collection/filter_data/
Authorization: Basic {{org-user-id}} {{org-user-pw}}

